  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Small grants to groups in Lebanon</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to provide small grants directly from CAFOD to initiatives in Lebanon, via community leaders, to test the process internally and trial out and learn from the process with local groups. Piloting this will enable CAFOD to provide direct small grants to local groups in case of an escalation in Lebanon and potential future emergencies in Lebanon and other contexts.</narrative>
  </description>
